      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Feeling that things are beyond saving is an incredibly heavy and painful weight to carry. When the environment feels like a complete loss, it's natural to question the value of continuing to participate. Before making any permanent decisions, remember that your identity and worth are not solely tied to the health of that external community or project. Allowing yourself time to process this grieving process is a necessary, if difficult, first step.",
      "source": "target",
